.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.local.example
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
/dazah-backend/.pytest-tmp-all
/dazah-backend/.pytest-tmp-all/**
/dazah-backend/.pytest-tmp-contract
/dazah-backend/.pytest-tmp-contract/**
**/.pytest-tmp*/
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/.coverage*
**/dist
**/build
**/*.log
# 仅排除运行时上传目录；不能用 **/storage，否则会误伤 app/platform/storage 业务模块
/dazah-backend/storage
/dazah-backend/uploads
/.deploy-tmp/
/.deploy-cache/
release
